{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders, comparing to the concat fusion baseline (config_009). Validation accuracy of 0.725 (F1: 0.685) slightly outperforms the concat baseline (0.7207 accuracy), suggesting weighted fusion may improve performance. However, uncertainty remains about the exact contribution of fusion strategy versus other untested factors, and whether further multimodal configurations could yield additional gains."
}

